name: ['Blighted Fen', 'Call the Bloodline', 'Clash of Wills', 'Crumbling Vestige', 'Fiery Temper', 'Flaying Tendrils', 'Goblin Warchief', "Nissa's Pilgrimage", 'Rise from the Tides', 'Smash to Smithereens', 'Spatial Contortion', 'Sylvan Scrying']
